t. Node rule checks, a scripted playthrough and replay on Engine.headless, Playwright browser suite with stub pad, touch profiles and Web Audio analyser, AI Hub harness in all four scenarios, two-page Visit tests, model sheets. Screenshots for what a script cannot check'\",\"'Headless only: node tests/run.mjs prints failures and a count. Node rule checks, a scripted playthrough, replay and input regression on Engine.headless, Playwright browser suite with stub pad, touch profiles and Web Audio analyser, AI Hub harness in all four scenarios, two-page Visit tests including invite codes and the public STUN server, model sheets. Screenshots for what a script cannot check'\")\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs; node tools/gen_exit.mjs; python3 -c \"import json;print(json.load(open('../exit-interview.json'))['testingFeedback'][1][:40])\"; echo \"Text updated, rebuilt. Running full suite twice (tests/shots/final{1,2}.log).\" >> ../PROGRESS.md; for i in 1 2; do node tests/run.mjs > tests/shots/final$i.log 2>&1; echo \"RUN$i exit $?\"; tail -3 tests/shots/final$i.log | cut -c1-300; done","description":"Update feedback; rebuild; run full suite twice","run_in_background":true,"timeout":1800000}}}
