{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm4BDMnAoicUBm8XTsZd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't re-examine a past run whose log was never kept, and that isn't a PLAN.md item anyway. What the hook is really asking for is verification against every PLAN.md item, and I can do that. I'll audit section by section and write the evidence to a file. Doing that turns up a few things I hadn't done: the plan asks for `renderSheet` contact sheets of key clips and for looking at the model sheet PNGs, Vesper should sing at melody pitches, and two day-table beats have no notice. I'll also let the credits roll to their natural end."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3269,"cache_read_input_tokens":891353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3269},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f147b5a-afdb-41c5-bbfc-62264f8c7cee","uuid":"7dac7d36-6ef1-4d54-922d-1fd619e72f9d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:37:58.551Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm4BCziKWzzkQ8tGhjPh"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm4BDMnAoicUBm8XTsZd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QhQQz9cMA8C3ZD5jtFsB7w","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n '/^### renderSheet()/,/^### /p' kit/API.md | cut -c1-260 | head -14; sed -n '/^### interface SheetImage/,/^### /p' kit/API.md | cut -c1-120 | head -8; python3 - <<'E'\ndef sub(p,a,b):\n    s=open(p).read(); assert a in s,(p,a[:70]); open(p,'w').write(s.replace(a,b,1))\np='src/ui/dialogue.js'\nsub(p,\"speakChar(G.ctx.audio, cast, text[i], i, text, o.volume ?? 1);\",\"speakChar(G.ctx.audio, cast, text[i], i, text, o.volume ?? 1, o.sing ? (cast.voice?.pitch ?? 0) + o.sing[i % o.sing.length] : null);\")\np='src/systems/year.js'\nsub(p,\"const s = say('vesper', verse, { actor }); yield s;\",\"w.stats.vesperSang = (w.stats.vesperSang ?? 0) + 1; const s = say('vesper', verse, { actor, sing: [0, 3, 7, 10, 7, 3, 5, 8, 12, 8, 5, 2] }); yield s;\")\nsub(p,\": inf.slot === 2 ? 'Vesper plays tonight on the plaza, at eight.' :\",\": yd === 11 ? 'Soup ingredients start to matter. Dorrit has been looking at your pockets.' : yd === 13 ? 'First snow. It came in the night and told nobody.' : inf.slot === 2 ? 'Vesper plays tonight on the plaza, at eight.' :\")\np='tests/play/playthrough.mjs'\nsub(p,\"// ---- save round trip and determinism\",\"\"\"// ---- Credits roll to their natural end without being skipped\n{ const s = G.openCredits(); let g = 0; while (!s.closed && g++ < 3000) e.step(5); check('credits roll to the end', s.closed && g < 3000, String(g)); check('credits leave no screen behind', !UI.stack.includes(s)); }\n// ---- save round trip and determinism\"\"\")\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs","description":"Read renderSheet API; add small plan items"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3269,"cache_read_input_tokens":891353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3269},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f147b5a-afdb-41c5-bbfc-62264f8c7cee","uuid":"8d2e066d-3cb0-496f-914d-289a700ce985","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:38:04.713Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm4BCziKWzzkQ8tGhjPh","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QhQQz9cMA8C3ZD5jtFsB7w":{"command":"sed -n '/^### renderSheet()/,/^### /p' kit/API.md | cut -c1-260 | head -14; sed -n '/^### interface SheetImage/,/^### /p' kit/API.md | cut -c1-120 | head -8; python3 - <<'E'\ndef sub(p,a,b):\n    s=open(p).read(); assert a in s,(p,a[:70]); open(p,'w').write(s.replace(a,b,1))\np='src/ui/dialogue.js'\nsub(p,\"speakChar(G.ctx.audio, cast, text[i], i, text, o.volume ?? 1);\",\"speakChar(G.ctx.audio, cast, text[i], i, text, o.volume ?? 1, o.sing ? (cast.voice?.pitch ?? 0) + o.sing[i % o.sing.length] : null);\")\np='src/systems/year.js'\nsub(p,\"const s = say('vesper', verse, { actor }); yield s;\",\"w.stats.vesperSang = (w.stats.vesperSang ?? 0) + 1; const s = say('vesper', verse, { actor, sing: [0, 3, 7, 10, 7, 3, 5, 8, 12, 8, 5, 2] }); yield s;\")\nsub(p,\": inf.slot === 2 ? 'Vesper plays tonight on the plaza, at eight.' :\",\": yd === 11 ? 'Soup ingredients start to matter. Dorrit has been looking at your pockets.' : yd === 13 ? 'First snow. It came in the night and told nobody.' : inf.slot === 2 ? 'Vesper plays tonight on the plaza, at eight.' :\")\np='tests/play/playthrough.mjs'\nsub(p,\"// ---- save round trip and determinism\",\"\"\"// ---- Credits roll to their natural end without being skipped\n{ const s = G.openCredits(); let g = 0; while (!s.closed && g++ < 3000) e.step(5); check('credits roll to the end', s.closed && g < 3000, String(g)); check('credits leave no screen behind', !UI.stack.includes(s)); }\n// ---- save round trip and determinism\"\"\")\nE\nnode tools/build.mjs","description":"Read renderSheet API; add small plan items"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QhQQz9cMA8C3ZD5jtFsB7w","type":"tool_result","content":"### renderSheet()\n\n```ts\nfunction renderSheet(model: Object3D, rig: RigSpec, def: ClipDef, clip: AnimationClip, options: SheetOptions = {}): SheetImage\n```\n\nRender a contact sheet for one clip.\n\n### interface RigSpec\n### interface SheetImage\n\nTiny RGBA software canvas shared by contact sheets, curve plots and filmstrips (no GPU, no DOM).\n\n- `width: number`\n- `height: number`\n- `data: Uint8ClampedArray`\n\nbuilt 6.6 MB","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f147b5a-afdb-41c5-bbfc-62264f8c7cee","uuid":"b16a8d8b-2572-417d-ad6a-e3a9cc6ca986","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:38:04.913Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### renderSheet()\n\n```ts\nfunction renderSheet(model: Object3D, rig: RigSpec, def: ClipDef, clip: AnimationClip, options: SheetOptions = {}): SheetImage\n```\n\nRender a contact sheet for one clip.\n\n### interface RigSpec\n### interface SheetImage\n\nTiny RGBA software canvas shared by contact sheets, curve plots and filmstrips (no GPU, no DOM).\n\n- `width: number`\n- `height: number`\n- `data: Uint8ClampedArray`\n\nbuilt 6.6 MB","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QhQQz9cMA8C3ZD5jtFsB7w","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgm4D27QtPXfthXPfgb3G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YGZaMPBnfFMQWgJ6L2BEfP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p tests/shots; cat > tests/tmp_sheet.mjs <<'E'\nimport { renderSheet, compileClips, buildModel, THREE } from '../src/engine.js';\nimport { writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { critterDef, RIG } from '../src/art/critter.js';\nimport { CLIP_DEFS } from '../src/actors/clips.js';\nconst obj = buildModel(critterDef({ id: 'sheet-p', species: 'person', c1: 'sand', shirt: 'red', trousers: 'navy', hair: 1 }), {}).object;\nconst clips = compileClips(CLIP_DEFS, RIG, obj);\nfor (const n of ['Walk', 'Run', 'NetSweep', 'Dig', 'HoldUp', 'Sit', 'Dance', 'PlayDead']) { const d = CLIP_DEFS.find((c) => c.name === n), c = clips.find((x) => x.name === n); const im = renderSheet(obj, RIG, d, c, {}); writeFileSync(`tests/shots/clip_${n}.rgba`, Buffer.from(im.data)); console.log(n, im.width, im.height); }\nE\ntimeout 60 node tests/tmp_sheet.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v '^`)' | cut -c1-160 | tail -9; cd tests/shots; for f in clip_*.rgba; do n=${f%.rgba}; s=$(grep -a . /dev/null; true); done; cd ../..; python3 - <<'E'\nimport subprocess,re,glob,os\nE\ntimeout 60 node tests/tmp_sheet.mjs 2>/dev/null | grep -E '^[A-Z]' | while read n w h; do magick -size ${w}x${h} -depth 8 rgba:tests/shots/clip_$n.rgba tests/shots/clip_$n.png; done; magick tests/shots/clip_Walk.png tests/shots/clip_NetSweep.png tests/shots/clip_HoldUp.png tests/shots/clip_Sit.png -append -resize 1500x tests/shots/clips.png; identify tests/shots/clips.png | cut -c1-60; rm -f tests/shots/*.rgba; timeout 120 node kit/check.mjs --sheets src/art/models.js >/dev/null 2>&1; ls check/sheets | wc -l; magick check/sheets/old-bell.png check/sheets/home0.png check/sheets/museum.png check/sheets/front-theatre.png -resize 750x +append tests/shots/sheets.png; identify tests/shots/sheets.png | cut -c1-60","description":"Render clip contact sheets and model sheets","timeout":280000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2486,"cache_read_input_tokens":894622,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2486},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f147b5a-afdb-41c5-bbfc-62264f8c7cee","uuid":"c970c5f2-b454-4028-9da0-2af5a6d46923","timestamp":"2026-11-06T04:38:13.532Z","request_id":"req_011Cgm4D1jqbFah2qX5QAzBV","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01YGZaMPBnfFMQWgJ6L2BEfP":{"command":"mkdir -p tests/shots; cat > tests/tmp_sheet.mjs <<'E'\nimport { renderSheet, compileClips, buildModel, THREE } from '../src/engine.js';\nimport { writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { critterDef, RIG } from '../src/art/critter.js';\nimport { CLIP_DEFS } from '../src/actors/clips.js';\nconst obj = buildModel(critterDef({ id: 'sheet-p', species: 'person', c1: 'sand', shirt: 'red', trousers: 'navy', hair: 1 }), {}).object;\nconst clips = compileClips(CLIP_DEFS, RIG, obj);\nfor (const n of ['Walk', 'Run', 'NetSweep', 'Dig', 'HoldUp', 'Sit', 'Dance', 'PlayDead']) { const d = CLIP_DEFS.find((c) => c.name === n), c = clips.find((x) => x.name === n); const im = renderSheet(obj, RIG, d, c, {}); writeFileSync(`tests/shots/clip_${n}.rgba`, Buffer.from(im.data)); console.log(n, im.width, im.height); }\nE\ntimeout 60 node tests/tmp_sheet.mjs 2>&1 | grep -v '^`)' | cut -c1-160 | tail -9; cd tests/shots; for f in clip_*.rgba; do n=${f%.rgba}; s=$(grep -a . /dev/null; true); done; cd ../..; python3 - <<'E'\nimport subprocess,re,glob,os\nE\ntimeout 60 node tests/tmp_sheet.mjs 2>/dev/null | grep -E '^[A-Z]' | while read n w h; do magick -size ${w}x${h} -depth 8 rgba:tests/shots/clip_$n.rgba tests/shots/clip_$n.png; done; magick tests/shots/clip_Walk.png tests/shots/clip_NetSweep.png tests/shots/clip_HoldUp.png tests/shots/clip_Sit.png -append -resize 1500x tests/shots/clips.png; identify tests/shots/clips.png | cut -c1-60; rm -f tests/shots/*.rgba; timeout 120 node kit/check.mjs --sheets src/art/models.js >/dev/null 2>&1; ls check/sheets | wc -l; magick check/sheets/old-bell.png check/sheets/home0.png check/sheets/museum.png check/sheets/front-theatre.png -resize 750x +append tests/shots/sheets.png; identify tests/shots/sheets.png | cut -c1-60","description":"Render clip contact sheets and model sheets","timeout":280000}}}
