nal_run.log, tests/PLAN_AUDIT.md\nAll roofs re-checked on sheets and in village; no game code changed since final_run.log. Finished.\njson ok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Aru6GsM99S4wgaWeM9PYoJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
